{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Veil: Mirages, a psychological thriller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veil is a short, movie-like experience that blends psychological horror with an\u00a0introspective narrative\u00a0and philosophical themes. Chase, a 19 year old boy in search of meaning, is haunted by memories of what he once had. Will he overcome his internal struggles, opening the door to reconciliation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated playtime: 2 hours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear and story-focused</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric 3D environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atari-style 2D segments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical themes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F10 to Screenshot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F11 to Toggle Fullscreen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift / R2 / RT to Sprint</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >486F7720636F756C6420686520646F20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7468697320746F206D653F20546F7373</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6564206D652061776179206C696B6520</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >616E206F7665727573656420746F7921</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2049276C6C206765742068696D20746F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >206F70656E207468617420646F6F722E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Square One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782410/42e341c95e9a8f05d74c36f15d5778dc95895d53.jpg"},{"name":"Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782410/892debcab5e111967efdc1085cb59d3a27ac41d4.j